{"version":1,"key":"card:15","content":{"id":15,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"TypeScript 内置了三个类型："},{"type":"formatted","text":"any","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"unknown","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"any","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示任意类型，一个变量如果标注为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"any","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，那么它可以接受任何类型的赋值，也可以赋值为任何的类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"let s: any = \"Hello World!\";\n// 可以赋值为 number 类型的变量\nconst n: number = s;\n// 可以接受任意类型的赋值\ns = 123;\n\n\n// 因为标注为 any，所以编译时不会报错，在运行时问题才暴露出来\ns.bar();","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"639b4715-3fca-4a14-9391-584dd30cfa4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由此可见，将变量标注为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"any","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型与写 JavaScript 没什么两样，TypeScript 的类型系统也就失去了意义，一般我们不知道一个变量类型或者类型太复杂的时候我们会标记为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"any","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是还是少用，否则 TypeScript 就变为了 AnyScript。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们声明变量时没有标注类型，会被隐式的推导为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"any","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// a 被隐式推导为了 any 类型\nlet a;\na = 1;\na = \"s\";","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"8e7e23a7-1a6d-4efd-9ebe-b64ab0981eaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// x 和 y 被隐式推导为 any\nfunction add(x, y) {\n  return x + y;\n}\nadd(1, 2);\nadd(1, \"Hello\");","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"cb67f036-d314-4355-aef8-983fb045d8db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// arr 被推导为了 any[]\nconst arr = [];\narr.push('a');\narr.push(1);","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"34ce209f-dd63-4b8f-95e7-cd456214215d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"tsconfig.json","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中开启了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"noImplicitAny","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项，那么就会禁止隐式推导为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"any","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们必须为变量标注类型，否则编译时就会报错。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"unknown","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示未知的类型，可以将任意值赋值给该类型的变量，但是使用该变量时，一定要断言为具体的类型才可以使用"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const a: unknown = 1;\n// ❎\nconst b: number = a;\n// ✅\nconst b: number = a as number;","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"b9e3955e-a5cf-4e17-b582-1dbbbed21f2b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示一个不存在的类型。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 这个函数不会返回任何内容，\nfunction(): never {\n  throw new Error();\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"6c14d159-81b3-4411-a09a-2efad7874f12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的变量能赋值给 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"any","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也不行，我们可以利用这一点来做编译时的检查。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设审核结果存在两种状态，过和不过，对于过和不过分别有相应的处理分支："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 0 表示过，1 表示不过\ntype Status = 0 | 1;\nlet status: Status;\n\nif (status === 0) {\n\n} else if (status === 1) {\n\n} else {\n  throw new Error('不存在的 status 值')\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"d455093b-5f24-48ab-bf92-3eae5cc75da5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设增加了一种状态，表示审核中，修改了类型的标注，但是忘记添加相应的处理分支，此时编译是可以通过的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 0 表示过，1 表示不过，2 表示审核中\ntype Status = 0 | 1 | 2;\nlet status: Status;\n\nif (status === 0) {\n\n} else if (status === 1) {\n\n} else {\n  throw new Error('不存在的 status 值')\n}\n","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"39a4cc10-5d9f-4732-9e11-319028264f4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只有当程序运行起来时我们才知道忘记处理审核中的状态了，如何在编译时保证我们处理了所有可能的情况呢，那就是在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"else","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中声明一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的变量"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"if (status === 0) {\n\n} else if (status === 1) {\n\n} else {\n  const _notExist: nerver = status;\n  throw new Error('不存在的 status 值')\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"b761e3e2-bc3a-42a2-ae98-7963030b9e59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们已经处理了所有的分支，那么到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"else","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分支中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"status","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 已经被收缩到了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，此时赋值便不会报错，但是如果我们没有处理所有可能的情况，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"status","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的类型就不是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为只有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的变量能赋值给"},{"type":"formatted","text":"never","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的变量，此时编译就会报错。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当开启了  "},{"type":"formatted","text":"noImplicitAny","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项，如果不给数组标注类型，数组默认是"},{"type":"formatted","text":"never[]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，此时我们不能像其中添加其它类型的内容，否则会报错"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// arr: never[];\nconst arr = [];\n// ❎\narr.push(1);","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"66aa2fa9-35bd-4945-87ce-4dd7d07d5418","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在工作经常看到不为数组标注类型的代码，导致一片飘红，这个还是要注意一下的。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["TypeScript/数据类型"],"createTime":1688913050267,"updateTime":1752924108253,"linkedCards":[{"id":142,"target":{"key":"card:142","type":"card","id":142},"summary":"一个值可能同时具有多种可能的类型，在断言为具体的类型之前只能使用公共的属性和方法 const strOrNum: string | number = \"a\"; // ❎ strOrNum.toLowerCase(); // ✅ (strOr...","tags":["TypeScript/类型守卫"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924108253}}